---
kind: lore
id: north.route13
title: Route 13 — the Strait
---

// Route 13 is the sea route from the Fairhaven shore north to Frostharbor.
// The engine keeps it behind the seaRoute gate (Surf + the Venom Badge).
// Swimmers by day; one night swimmer who only comes out after dark.

<beat id="enter" on="enterRoute" target="route.r13" title="Route 13" priority="10">
  ::bg{location="route-13" time="day"}
  ::music{action="change" mood="upbeat" volume="normal"}
  @narrator: The shore drops away and the water turns from green to slate. A buoy clangs somewhere to the north.
  @narrator: A sign bolted to the buoy reads: ROUTE 13 — THE STRAIT. FROSTHARBOR 9 KM. SWIMMERS KEEP LEFT OF THE FERRY LANE.
</beat>

<entry id="northR13Day" on="enterRoute" target="route.r13" category="bark" once="day" when="!@isNight">
  @narrator: Swimmers' caps bob between the waves. The Strait is busy today.
</entry>

<entry id="northR13Night" on="enterRoute" target="route.r13" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator: At night the Strait is black and loud. Something in the water glows, and a lone swimmer's lamp moves against the current.
</entry>

// ── trainers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r13SwimmerLena" who="r13SwimmerLena" intro="You're riding your monster? That's cheating! Real swimmers use their arms!" win="Fine, fine. Your arms are rested and mine aren't." lose="Stroke, stroke, breathe! That's how it's done!" prize="1400"/>

<entry id="northR13SwimmerLenaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r13SwimmerLena" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r13SwimmerLena))">
  @r13SwimmerLena: I swim to Frostharbor and back every day. The cold keeps you honest.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r13SwimmerTod" who="r13SwimmerTod" intro="Hey! I've been treading water for an hour waiting for someone to battle!" win="Worth the wait, honestly." lose="An hour well spent!" prize="1400"/>

<entry id="northR13SwimmerTodAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r13SwimmerTod" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r13SwimmerTod))">
  @r13SwimmerTod: My toes went numb at minute forty. Don't tell anyone.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r13FishermanWade" who="r13FishermanWade" intro="You scared off my bite! You owe me a battle, at least." win="Nothing's biting today. Not even my monsters." lose="Reeled you in!" prize="1600"/>

<entry id="northR13FishermanWadeAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r13FishermanWade" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r13FishermanWade))">
  @r13FishermanWade: The big ones come up the Strait on Fridays. Everyone in Frostharbor knows it, nobody knows why.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r13SailorBrig" who="r13SailorBrig" intro="Ahoy! Stand to and fight, landlubber!" win="Blow me down. Properly down." lose="Ha! Back to port with you!" prize="1800"/>

<entry id="northR13SailorBrigAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r13SailorBrig" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r13SailorBrig))">
  @r13SailorBrig: The Meridian won't sail this far north. Too much ice in winter. We work the fishing boats instead.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r13BirdKeeperIsla" who="r13BirdKeeperIsla" intro="My birds fly the Strait faster than you can swim it. Let me show you!" win="Grounded. Ugh." lose="Nothing beats a tailwind!" prize="1500"/>

<entry id="northR13BirdKeeperIslaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r13BirdKeeperIsla" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r13BirdKeeperIsla))">
  @r13BirdKeeperIsla: Seabirds won't fly near the caverns east of Frostharbor. They say something cold nests in there.
</entry>

// The night swimmer: out only after dark.
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r13SwimmerNoor" when="@isNight" who="r13SwimmerNoor" intro="You found me by my lamp. Most people just see a light and paddle the other way." win="You're good in the dark. Better than me." lose="Night water is my water." prize="2000"/>

<entry id="northR13SwimmerNoorAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r13SwimmerNoor" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r13SwimmerNoor))">
  @r13SwimmerNoor: The jellyfish glow at night. If you follow them you never lose the shore.
</entry>

// ── Lifeguard Bea, on the buoy platform ─────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="northBeaBark" on="talk" target="npc.r13Lifeguard" category="bark">
  @r13Lifeguard: Keep left of the ferry lane, rest on the buoys, and if you see a jellyfish glowing, don't touch it. It's not being friendly.
</entry>

<entry id="northBeaNight" on="talk" target="npc.r13Lifeguard" category="bark" priority="5" when="@isNight">
  @r13Lifeguard: I'm not on duty at night. I'm just here. Somebody has to keep an eye on Noor.
</entry>
